    end
    subgraph EDGE["Zone: Edge / Gateway"]
        GW[API Gateway / WAF]
    end
    subgraph APP["Zone: Application Tier"]
        Svc[Service]
    end
    subgraph DATA["Zone: Data Tier"]
        DB[(Datastore)]
        KMS[[KMS / Secrets]]
    end
    subgraph MGMT["Zone: Management Plane"]
        Admin[Admin / CI-CD]
    end
    User -->|TLS| GW -->|authn| Svc --> DB
    Svc -->|fetch secret| KMS
    Admin -.->|privileged| Svc
```

